---
/**
 * Terms of Use (D121), at the old site's /terms-conditions/ URL. Replaces the
 * old page, which was a generic generator template that described things this
 * site does not have (user comments, advertising partners' cookies). Written
 * to be true of the new site; should be reviewed by the clinic's counsel.
 */
import LegalPage from '../layouts/LegalPage.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
const a = site.address;
---
<LegalPage title="Terms of Use" updated="Updated September 2026"
           description="The terms for using East Valley Naturopathic Doctors' website, including the limits of the health information it contains.">
  <p>These terms apply to your use of this website. By using it, you agree to them. If you don't
  agree, please don't use the site.</p>

  <h2>Health information is not medical advice</h2>
  <p>Everything on this website — articles, condition and treatment pages, videos and webinars — is
  general information for education. It is not medical advice, and it is not a substitute for an
  examination, diagnosis or treatment by a qualified health care provider who knows your history.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Reading this website does not make you our patient.</strong> A provider–patient
    relationship begins only when you are seen by one of our practitioners.</li>
    <li>Talk to your own provider before starting, stopping or changing any treatment, supplement
    or medication.</li>
    <li>Treatments described here may not be right for you, and results vary from person to person.</li>
    <li>Some articles are several years old. Medical knowledge changes, and an older article may not
    reflect current research.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="legal-note"><strong>In an emergency, call 911</strong> or go to the nearest emergency
  room. Do not use this website, email, forms or text messages for urgent medical needs.</p>

  <h2>Appointments and online tools</h2>
  <p>Online booking, forms and the patient portal are provided by other companies (see our
  <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>), and their own terms apply when you use them.</p>
  <p>If you receive text messages from us, our <a href="/messaging-terms/">SMS Messaging Terms &amp;
  Conditions</a> apply.</p>

  <h2>Photographs</h2>
  <p>Photographs of our practitioners are of our own team. Some other photographs on this site are
  licensed stock images used for illustration. They do not show our patients, staff or clinic.</p>

  <h2>Accuracy</h2>
  <p>We work to keep this website accurate and current, but we can't guarantee that every page is
  complete or up to date. Services, providers, hours and fees can change. Call us to confirm
  anything that matters to your decision.</p>

  <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>We link to research, government resources and other outside websites for your reference. We
  don't control those sites and aren't responsible for their content, availability or privacy
  practices. A link is not an endorsement.</p>

  <h2>Our content</h2>
  <p>The text, graphics, logos and other content on this website belong to {site.name} or to the
  people who licensed them to us. You're welcome to view, print and share pages for personal,
  non-commercial use. Please don't republish, sell or copy our content for other purposes without
  our written permission. Linking to our pages is always fine.</p>

  <h2>Using the site</h2>
  <p>Please don't try to disrupt the website, get into parts of it that aren't public, or use it
  for anything unlawful.</p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>This website is provided “as is.” To the fullest extent the law allows, {site.name} is not
  liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of the website or reliance on its content.
  Nothing in these terms limits any right you have that cannot be limited by law.</p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Arizona.</p>

  <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>We may update these terms. The date at the top shows when they last changed.</p>

  <h2>Contact us</h2>
  <p>{site.name}<br />
  {a.street}, {a.city}, {a.state} {a.zip}<br />
  <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a> · <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>
</LegalPage>
